WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.155
Lech's conjecture from nineteen sixty.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.343
Multiplicity measures how singular a local ring is;

3
00:00:05.343 --> 00:00:07.568
Lech said flat maps never lower it.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.941
Work in characteristic p with Frobenius-based multiplicities, then carry the result back.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.367
Claimed: proved in every dimension and characteristic.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.226
Lean checks only part.
